    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gatmooda ea ichibooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geadaah gwadeagooda haw aba humng'eeda was gatmooda siikwealsa aseeta, nea gwanda jeeda baneaguuka geeshangaaschi sheeda, nea uhuudaanyi gwanda shiipka miinga atamaniyeenya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny abeeda ea bungaroocheanda gil, ak gooyeawda aba lajooda jeata, ak gwasawana aba jeata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geadaah gwadeagooda nuut aba humng'eeda, ng'ula, hararjooda haw areara, mideawa iheeni ispwa ea gujaw damanamughuush, nea iheenga nyaawa gaba nih mideawa shiip ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea shoomng'eandaanyi goongiir miinga humng'eeda heeda haw, ak gwahisa badayda ng'eanyiida. Hean ghamiinaada ichiboodida aba madeedeaba gatmoodida riikghta gwaji jeeptean, ak abeeda ghwanukghuta jeaptaanyi damanda jiila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gwaji baleanda was baleanda, ak gayghoahaaghwa eemoojiga sean aba bileangida gharinyeanda, ak baleandaanyi geetiing'da ea gawa heeda ASEETA ea heeda hoorgeadaanyi bea gheambalmeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu gamng'aw gatmoodida gawa dareapcheeda, nea nisissa ASEETA heechea goobiida, ak geerear ak goobiida hoowa eawooji sagalama ea bughalaji iyeenya ea laadam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat ng'ucheeda aba humng'eeda, gang'uchi Mikaeli ea malaykajeagaaschi sea hararjoodida; ak gang'uchi ichibooda sea saawa ea malaykajeagaaschi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu geajoar ak ea mudugwanda heechea goobiida aba humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geejaksa ng'eanyi hararjoodida haw was ichiboodeaba garayiin, siguura Meang'nyeandeenda ea Shataani, was dea reengani ng'eanyiisean, ak geejagu badayda ng'eanyiida, ak eara malaykajeagaaschi geehisu ghapka ng'eanyi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaayiinyi nyeashta haw nyaasha humng'eeda nea gwayi, “Ghamneawa lealeanooda ea uurda ea Sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETEANYA ea gheambalmeeda Gristoydaanyi nihidu, aba gideaba sijaksa ng'eanyi dea aheakiida fuga siduupcheewi, ninyeeda aheakiida aba madeeda ASEETEANYA askweari ea eawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwajoar aba foojeanda Dayeenda Gisilleanda, ea aba ng'asheanda muuwuunooda nyaawa, ak ea mwabwariinya eaweega nyaawa eara gaweay miyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ang'weela, Ea humng'eeda, ea agoogeeni oondi jeedean! Asi agooga ashageada, Ea ng'eanyiida ea basooda, aba gideaba meang'nyeandeenda nirarang'aan ghwahidu heedeang'wa nea gaba nyarasta haw aba gideaba ghwanal gwandeawa gheadi nuwaas!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah ichiboodida gideaba sijaksa badayda ng'eanyiida, hean ghwaat geeshteaba gatmoodida jih baleanda was baleandean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geataw gatmoodida meang'i iyeenya bea rabearda haw ak ghang'eata gawa dareapcheeda sheageewa ichiboodida, ak gawa heeda jea gweagiischi gheadi nuwaas, sheeh haradam ea iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarina ghuuteaba ichiboodida beega uurji gea eenda, aba badayda gatmoodida, ak ghwanung' ghwaat guldeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghaweat ng'eanyiida gatmooda, ak ghwajaat ng'eanyiida ghuutaanyi ak ghwanukghuta eendida rinna ghuuta ichiboodean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanyareeksa ichibooda gatmoodida, ak ghang'eat gawa ghoang'eat ng'ucheeda sea jeata siipuut bea gatmoodean, sea fugiga ang'waay digheanyeeka ASEETA nea gamuuwu iita Yesuun. Ak ghamiinaada aba badayda iseaskweanda basooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada ichibooda aba ghuuta basooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
